# Standard Slides Keep Automatic Content Inside The Canvas

Automatic Markdown layout should use the 10 by 7.5 inch slide rather than the wide-screen constants. This deliberately long sentence must wrap before the right edge.

| Workstream | Current state | Next decision |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Document layout | Stable | Preserve parity |
| Presentation layout | Expanding | Verify 4:3 geometry |
| Review catalogue | Automated | Inspect meaningful differences |

---

# Mixed Automatic Content Uses The Available Height

- Titles, prose, lists, and media remain inside the standard slide.
- Footer and slide-number fields remain visible at the bottom.
- Content groups share the available height without overlap.

